# Android debug audit loop — AUTOMATIC

**Always on** when debugging, changing, or shipping Android/APK work. Combines artifact audits with UI/runtime discipline per [Google Android Developer Fundamentals](https://google-developer-training.github.io/android-developer-fundamentals-course-concepts-v2/) and [Android Studio debug tools](https://developer.android.com/studio/debug).

Full reference: `docs/ANDROID_DEBUG_AUDIT_LOOP.md`

## Before claiming APK/mobile work is done

1. **Static audit** — `python3 scripts/audit_apk_launch_ready.py` → `LAUNCH_READY` (includes APK-008 UI layout check).
2. **Layout vs content** — if bootstrap strings, assets, or layouts changed, verify primary actions (e.g. copy button) remain visible on small screens.
3. **Document the loop** — append to `evidence/mobile/android/debug_audit_log.jsonl` (action, order, outcome, device/emulator if run).

## Core loop rules (mandatory)

| Rule | Requirement |
|------|-------------|
| **Document** | Record what you did, step order, result (success/crash/unexpected) |
| **One change** | Change one variable at a time; re-run after each change |
| **Check details** | Log device model, API level, permissions, build variant, network |
| **Reproduce** | Same environment each run; note intermittent failures |
| **Timestamp** | Correlate actions with Logcat / audit log timestamps |
| **Close loop** | After fix: re-run full audit; confirm no regression; update docs |

## Tools (use when runtime available)

- **Logcat** — capture before/after each change
- **Layout Inspector** — verify views visible in hierarchy (copy button not off-screen)
- **Debugger** — breakpoints, step through, inspect variables, call stack
- **ADB** — `adb install`, `adb logcat`, `adb shell dumpsys`
- **Layout XML review** — when no device: ScrollView + pinned critical buttons

## Forbidden

- ❌ `LAUNCH_READY` from static checks only when user reports UI failure — treat as open loop
- ❌ Changing bootstrap/assets without checking `activity_main.xml` scroll/pin constraints
- ❌ Skipping documentation because "it was a small fix"
- ❌ Multiple simultaneous changes without recording which caused the fix

## Response footer (Android work shipped)

```
Android audit loop: PASS (static + layout check)
device_runtime: UNEXECUTED | VERIFIED — <how>
```
